// Block merge family, query owned by block_merge_sort_lib. Thirteen buffers (in
// the array or external, by six sizes, or none) by two key shapes by fifteen
// rotations, every one carving by the scan, 390 entries.

BlockMergeSorts: SortingAlgorithm = SortingAlgorithm<BlockMergeSort<buffer = _, keys = _, rot = _, extract = _ where ( ScanExtraction )>>
